P Residual norm 1.022707038617e-09\n   45 KSP Residual norm 7.775847120729e-10\n   46 KSP Residual norm 5.802691424658e-10\n   47 KSP Residual norm 4.334939619132e-10\n   48 KSP Residual norm 3.253341124123e-10\n   49 KSP Residual norm 2.268033611956e-10\n   50 KSP Residual norm 1.496894794903e-10\n   51 KSP Residual norm 1.037306997102e-10\n   52 KSP Residual norm 7.311048575953e-11\n   53 KSP Residual norm 5.668454161473e-11\n   54 KSP Residual norm 4.250977949259e-11\n   55 KSP Residual norm 3.004596335844e-11\n   56 KSP Residual norm 2.162011426293e-11\n   57 KSP Residual norm 1.465659188556e-11\n    Linear solve converged due to CONVERGED_RTOL iterations 57\n  1 SNES Function norm 3.142736311646e-11\n  Nonlinear solve converged due to CONVERGED_FNORM_RELATIVE iterations 1\n=== Grad-Shafranov (Solov'ev) FE solve ===\nDomain: R in [0.5,1.5], Z in [-1.,1.]\nConstants: C1 = 1., C2 = 1.\nGlobal degrees of freedom: 741\nSNES converged reason: CONVERGED_FNORM_RELATIVE (Newton its = 1)\nKSP  converged reason: CONVERGED_RTOL\n||psi||_2   = 3.6216830303e+00\n||psi||_inf = 2.2255147415e-01\nRESULT: SOLVE CONVERGED SUCCESSFULLY"
